---
title: "Creating a data source: five files, five renames"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: nothing yet
  s1: staged, invisible to the plugin
  s2: visible source after 1/3 files
  s3: process died, 0/3 files on disk
  s4: visible source after 2/3 files
  s5: process died, 1/3 files on disk
  s6: created, source collects
  s7: process died, 2/3 files on disk
  s8: process died, 3/3 files on disk
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you press create
  s1 --> s0: a write fails, rollback
  s1 --> s2: the config files land
  s1 --> s3: the process is killed
  s0 --> s3: you press create
  s2 --> s0: a write fails, rollback
  s2 --> s4: the target file lands
  s2 --> s5: the process is killed
  s4 --> s0: a write fails, rollback
  s4 --> s6: the collector file lands
  s4 --> s7: the process is killed
  s6 --> s8: the process is killed
